Subject: [PATCH 45/47] metal: gate forward FFT probe (prediction path)

submitForward() matches ducc0 c2c FORWARD to 3.3e-07 at 1024 and
5.9e-07 at 3072 (12.5ms). Both c2c directions are now proven.

